Step 4: Total favorable outcomes
Each suit has 3 such valid pairs → 2 suits → total favorable outcomes: Favorable=3​ (spades)+3​ (hearts)=6\text{Favorable}=3\text{ (spades)}+3\text{ (hearts)}=6
Step 5: Compute the probability Probability=FavorableTotal=6325\text{Probability}=\frac{\text{Favorable}}{\text{Total}}=\frac{6}{325}
Final Answer: 6325\boxed{\frac{6}{325}}
